cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Pancreas Radiomics Atlas
message: >-
  This atlas is a pancreas-specific subset of the RADAPT dataset. If you use these data,
  please cite the RADAPT publication listed below.
type: dataset
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-17
